  "solution": "1. × and +\n\n30 × __**54 ÷ 18**__ - 48 + 16 = 58\n\n⇒ __**30 × **__**__3__** - 48 + 16 = 58\n\n⇒ **__90__** - 48 __**+ 16**__ = 58\n\n⇒ **__106__**__** - 48**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 58 = 58\n\n2. ÷ and +\n\n__**30 ÷ 54**__ + 18 - __**48 × 16**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.55**____** +**____** 18**__ - 768 = 58\n\n⇒ __**18.55**____** **____**- 768**__ = 58\n\n⇒ -749.45 ≠ 58\n\n3. ÷ and × \n\n30 + 54 × 18 - 48 ÷ 16 = 58\n\n⇒ 30 + __**54 **____**×**____** 18**__ - __**48 **____**÷**____** 16**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**30 + 972**__ - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ __**1002 - 3**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 999 ≠ 58\n\n4. + and -\n\n30 - __**54 ÷ 18**__ + __**48 × 16**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**30**__ - 3 __**+ 768**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 798 - 3 = 58\n\n⇒ 795 ≠ 58\n\nHence, '**× and +**' is the correct answer.",
